reement with mcdonald's  worth an estimated 15 million dollars  over four years to instead gamble on the  fast-growing blaze pizza chain where  he's an investor  he's taken equity in brands like smart  gym maker tonal and rideshare giant lift  as well  then there's spring hill the tv and  movie production outfit built by james  and business partner maverick carter  last october outside investors bought  into the venture which helped produce  the 163 million dollar space jam a new  legacy an hbo documentary what's my name  muhammad ali at a 725 million dollar  valuation  james of course remains the biggest  shareholder  james has publicly dreamed about one day  owning an nba team and he's well on his  way the basketball star already counts  pro baseball  soccer and hockey teams among his  holdings  but his fortune wouldn't be complete  without his real estate holdings  he owns at least three properties worth  about 80 million dollars in all he built  a 10 million dollar mansion near his  hometown of akron ohio and he bought an  eight bedroom property in la for 23  million dollars  his latest splurge a 13 000 square foot  beverly hills mansion james paid  36.75 million dollars for the home which  he has already torn down to replace with  a mansion of his own  [Music]  you
 

